+    // block 17 (the two-arm server): run the server with TWO ARMS on one GPU.  The
+    // prompt being processed and the reply being generated then no longer take turns inside one graph: the
+    // server keeps a PREFILL arm (its context + thread, multiplexing the prompt slots) and a DECODE arm (its own
